 "decisions": {
  "D0-g0": "g0_d0: 30 EnGrads (6 per n_atoms quintile of D0G1 + D0G3) + 10 undisplaced D0 label TSs (n_atoms quantiles 0.05-0.95; not the 24 Phase I d0_ts_grad reactions) + D0G2 pilots (--n-g2 auto: 1 = the first ranked pool unit with n_atoms <= the pool median, only if the plan selects > 0 D0G2 reactions; their measured core-h enters the total); fit = D0 log-log over every ok D0 EnGrad on disk if >= 10, else the D1 G-0 fit x the mean D0 / D1-fit ratio; xTB Freq c N^2 from the D0 Hessians (>= 3) else the prior; budget basis D0-budget; parity: median > 1e-3 Eh/bohr = off_stationary, > 10 x the D1 label-TS median = above_10x_d1_median (flags, never a stop); total > 5,000 core-h = exit 3 (spec STOP).",
  "D0-G2": "pool = G2c D0 TSs ($G2C/d0/g2_final: lowest of 3 autodE xTB runs, label atom order) with result.json status ok, the G-2sel Hessian rules (gen_dft.g2_hess_check) and the label element order, minus overlaps and the 24 d1_validation D0 reactions; strata = D0 dipole class; ranking = per-stratum shuffled positions (j + u_s) / n_s merged (default_rng([SEED, 2,000,000, 2])), so every prefix is ~proportional; N = the largest prefix with D1 + D0 G1 + G3 + D0 G2 <= 5,000 x (1 - 0.10) core-h on the budget basis (D0-budget; units already on disk cost 0, their measured core-h is fixed); input = the G3L builder with charge1 + charge2 and the label forming bonds; records runs/D0G2/<rid>. A re-plan that changes the selection while a selected unit has an OptTS start without unit.json is refused (exit 2) unless --force.",
  "D0-level": "D0 label TS = Coley G16 B3LYP-D3BJ/def2-SVP SMD(water) OptTS (profile TS_*.xyz, 5 decimals = the eda.inp coordinates); the reactants are the Coley r*.xyz (G16 level, inferred). Not stationary at the ORCA label level (Phase I d0_ts_grad median max|g| 4.7e-4 Eh/bohr vs D1 1.4e-5, ~30x): a program / level difference (G16 B3LYP = VWN3 vs ORCA B3LYP = VWN5, RIJCOSX def2/J, ORCA SMD, grids), not rounding; the D1 config 'parity with the D0 labels' refers to the TZVP SP / EDA stage, not to this gradient level. Every D0 structure is ordinary label-level E/F data; nothing assumes zero force; g0_d0 flags the parity against 10 x the measured D1 label-TS median (recorded, never a stop).",
  "D0-budget": "budget basis (plan_d0 and g0_d0): D1 = max(D1 G-0 total, G-0 group prediction x max(1, observed / fitted core-h of the running D1 G1 / G2 / G3 records)); D0 EnGrad + xTB costs = fit x the D1 production slowdown (G-0-weighted max(1, observed ratio) of G1 + G3: g0 nodes run 16 workers, production 64); D0G2 = D1 g2 fit x max(1, D1 G-0 pilot ratio, D1 observed G2 ratio, D0 pilot / fit). Fits: the g0_d0 fits when G0_estimate_d0.json belongs to this plan (fingerprint without n_near), else the D1 G-0 fits + the xTB prior. Total > 5,000 core-h = g0_d0 exit 3 (spec STOP); g0_d0 also reports the total with --n-near 1.",
  "D0-nnear": "--n-near 1|2 (default 2 = the G1 rule) may change after D0 records exist (same fingerprint apart from n_near): the n1 / i rows are identical for both values; records of dropped n2 rows stay on disk and collect --d0 keeps them (reported as extra)."
